  m_Name: NewSoul 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SoulData
  soulName: Adrian Wells
  age: 38
  causeOfDeath: "Apartman yang\u0131n\u0131nda dumandan zehirlenme"
  introDialogueSegments:
  - "Merhaba... San\u0131r\u0131m do\u011Fru yere geldim."
  - "Gece apartmanda yang\u0131n \xE7\u0131kt\u0131."
  - "Ben zaten d\u0131\u015Far\u0131 \xE7\u0131km\u0131\u015Ft\u0131m asl\u0131nda."
  - "Ama \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC kattaki kom\u015Fumun k\xFC\xE7\xFCk k\u0131z\u0131n\u0131n
    i\xE7eride kald\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6ylediler."
  - "\u0130tfaiye hen\xFCz gelmemi\u015Fti."
  - "Bir kez daha i\xE7eri girdim. \xC7ocu\u011Fu merdivenlere kadar getirdim."
  - "Sonras\u0131n\u0131 pek hat\u0131rlam\u0131yorum... san\u0131r\u0131m duman
    \xE7ok fazlayd\u0131."
  - "Ama \xE7ocuk kurtuldu de\u011Fil mi?"
  fileSummary: "Dosya No: 4821-A\n\nKonu: Adrian Wells, 38 ya\u015F\u0131nda. \xD6l\xFCm
    nedeni yo\u011Fun dumana maruz kalma.\n\nOlay raporlar\u0131na g\xF6re s\xF6z
    konusu ki\u015Fi, yang\u0131n s\u0131ras\u0131nda binadan g\xFCvenli \u015Fekilde
    tahliye edildikten sonra tekrar i\xE7eri girmi\u015Ftir. Ama\xE7, \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC
    katta mahsur kalan bir \xE7ocu\u011Fu kurtarmakt\u0131r.\n\nTan\u0131k ifadeleri
    ve itfaiye raporlar\u0131, ki\u015Finin \xE7ocu\u011Fu merdiven bo\u015Flu\u011Funa
    kadar ula\u015Ft\u0131rmay\u0131 ba\u015Fard\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 do\u011Frulamaktad\u0131r.
    \xC7ocuk olaydan sa\u011F kurtulmu\u015Ftur.\n\nKi\u015Fi ise bina i\xE7erisinde
    bilincini kaybetmi\u015F halde bulunmu\u015F ve dumandan zehirlenme sonucu hayat\u0131n\u0131
    kaybetmi\u015Ftir.\n\nHerhangi bir su\xE7 kayd\u0131 bulunmamaktad\u0131r."
